        {
          "_type": "UMLPackage",
          "_id": "c4-pkg-2590",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "c4-model-0002"
          },
          "name": "3.8 — Components · Card Renderer",
          "documentation": "Inside cards.mjs. Cards are painted with canvas rather than ffmpeg drawtext, for real layout control and so the logo composites with alpha. Brand assets come from one directory and nowhere else.",
          "ownedElements": [
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2591",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "Copy parser",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: cards.mjs + script.mjs\n\nThe intro and outro header directives, split on a pipe into headline and subhead. Both appear on the card and both are read aloud. Without a pipe the text becomes the subhead under a default headline."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2592",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "Style guide reader",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: brand.mjs · shared\n\nColour and type from brand/StyleGuide.txt, shared with the compositor so the style-guide hex cannot end up in one stage and not the other."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2593",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "Font loader",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: cards.mjs + @napi-rs/canvas\n\nRegisters every font file in the brand directory. Falls back loudly and states what the card is actually set in, because a silent fallback and a successful resolve otherwise look identical in the log."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2594",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "Card painter",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: @napi-rs/canvas\n\nThe brand hex flat across the top 55% and deepening below, so sampling the field returns the style-guide colour rather than a near-black navy. Then the logo, the CTA green rule, and the type wrapped and balanced so two lines do not come out as a long one and a stub. The block is measured first, then drawn optically centred."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2595",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "TTS gateway",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: tts.mjs · shared\n\nThe same provider, cache and breath trim the narrator uses. Sharing it is why the cards sit at the same level as the body of the video instead of the join being audible."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2596",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "Clip builder",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: ffmpeg\n\nStill plus voice, with a lead-in long enough to clear the dissolve. The outro is the incoming side of the last fade, so a shorter lead would put its first word inside that fade — the one place a card can start quiet. Only the outer edges fade to black."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2597",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "Joiner",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: ffmpeg xfade + acrossfade\n\nNormalises frame rate, pixel format and timebase on every input first, then dissolves card into demo. Filters rather than the concat demuxer, so mismatched encoder settings between the cards and the composed video cannot corrupt the join."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClassDiagram",
              "_id": "c4-dgm-2598",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2590"
              },
              "name": "C4-L3 — Components · Card Renderer (cards.mjs)",
              "documentation": "Level 3, container \"8 · Card Renderer\".",
              "defaultDiagram": false,
              "ownedViews": [
                {
                  "_type": "UMLClassView",
                  "_id": "c4-v-2599",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "c4-dgm-2598"
                  },
                  "model": {
                    "$ref": "c4-el-2591"
                  },
                  "subViews": [
                    {
                      "_type": "UMLNameCompartmentView",
                      "_id": "c4-nc-2600",
                      "_parent": {
                        "$ref": "c4-v-2599"
                      },
                      "model": {
                        "$ref": "c4-el-2591"
                      },
                      "subViews": [
                        {
                          "_type": "LabelView",
                          "_id": "c4-lbl-2601",
                          "_parent": {
                            "$ref": "c4-nc-2600"
                          },
                          "model": {
                            "$ref": "c4-el-2591"
                          },
                          "visible": true,
                          "font": "Arial;11;0",
                          "left": 65,
                          "top": 45,
                          "width": 210,
                          "height": 13,
                          "text": "«component: cards.mjs + script.mjs»",
                          "horizontalAlignment": 2,
                          "verticalAlignment": 5
